<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Stocks to Watch Today - Oct 24.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Stocks to Watch Today - Oct 24.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Some Australian stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>*Tyndall Australia Ltd A$1.96 (+.01)</p>
<p>Fund manager to make annoucement today on possible acquisition. Earlier this week, Tyndall said it was in talks that could lead to a potential acquisition.</p>
<p>*Discovery Petroleum NL A$0.80 (+.01)</p>
<p>Discovery suitor Premier Oil Plc plans to meet executives of the Australian oil producer today in an attempt to reach terms on an agreed offer. Premier is currently offering 70 cents per Discovery share.</p>
<p>*Seven Network Ltd A$3.93 (+.01)</p>
<p>The television network may give an indication of first quarter trading at today's annual meeting.</p>
<p>*Newcrest Mining Ltd A$4.47 (-.01)</p>
<p>Gold producer may give indication of first quarter trading and production at today's annual meeting.</p>
<p>*Pacific Dunlop Ltd A$2.78 (-.02)</p>
<p>Conglomerate sells its troubled pacemaker Telectronics unit for A$170 million to St Jude Medical Inc of the United States after the market close on Wednesday.</p>
<p>*Colly Cotton Ltd</p>
<p>Active trade expected on the debut of share market listing of the cotton producer.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
